caption:
Did you know, our lobby is set up as a free co-work space? Tables, plugs, comfortable seating, free wifi, and no reservations. We named it the Hub Collective because of our desire to create an organic community hub and idea incubator, and  we knew space was a much needed piece of the puzzle. Host a pop up meeting or just grab your headphones and laptop and get some work out creating done. 

@gud2gobytus is open until 4pm for your caffeine or pork belly fix. 

Follow us at @thehubpomona
